        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Ransom (1996 film), Blackmail (2005 film)\n- People: Ron Howard, Richard Price, Alexander Ignon, Mel Gibson, Rene Russo, Gary Sinise, Brawley Nolte, Delroy Lindo, Liev Schreiber, Evan Handler, Donnie Wahlberg, Lili Taylor\n- Roles: director, writer, actor, musician\n- Awards: Emmy Award, Golden Globe Award, Hollywood Walk of Fame, Academy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Alan Sinise was born on March 17, 1955, and he is an American actor, director, and musician.\n- Gary Sinise has won an Emmy Award, a Golden Globe Award, and a star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame, and he has been nominated for an Academy Award.\n- Ransom is a 1996 American crime thriller film directed by Ron Howard and written by Richard Price and Alexander Ignon.\n- Ransom stars Mel Gibson, Rene Russo, Gary Sinise, Brawley Nolte, Delroy Lindo, Liev Schreiber, Evan Handler, Donnie Wahlberg, and Lili Taylor.\n- Blackmail is a 2005 film inspired by the 1996 Hollywood film Ransom.",
